This draft is only for learning the editor. It stays a draft, so it never appears on the site. Change **Status** to Published on a copy, never on this one.

## Writing

Use headings (H2 and H3), **bold**, *italic*, [links](/contact), bulleted and numbered lists, quotes and tables from the toolbar. Every H2 appears in the "On this page" list beside the article.

- Keep paragraphs short: three or four sentences.
- Upload images with the image button; they are stored with the site.

## Ready-made graphics

Insert → Graphic, then pick one from the list. They animate when scrolled into view and stop when the reader turns motion off.

{% graphic name="hero-engine" caption="Every channel feeding one plan." /%}

